ike the precursors of the Tremere? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1164782-lilitu-clan?p=1165064#post1165064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What book might we get the Lilitu in?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe Spilled Blood?<ul><li><b>Spilled Blood:</b> Fallen clans, alternate bloodlines, other kinds of vampires. <i>PDF/PoD</i></li> </ul><br /> This is my new most expected book for Vampire. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-04T11:07:59-08:00","id":1165095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Max Deltree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1164782-lilitu-clan?p=1165075#post1165075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Breath-drinkers? Like the precursors of the Tremere? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Maybe Spilled Blood?<ul><li><b>Spilled Blood:</b> Fallen clans, alternate bloodlines, other kinds of vampires. <i>PDF/PoD</i></li> </ul>This is my new most expected book for Vampire. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div> Fucking Brilliant! I had forgotten they'd announced Spilled Blood, that is the Vampire Book I'm most excited for, I hope they have a side bar for Fallen Clan Dampyr's. <br /> <br /> I think the Clan Disciplines with be Majesty, Nightmare, Resilience or a Cruac like Discipline. I can see the Lilitu having invented the Wet Dreams Devotion.<br /> <br /> As far the Tremere I can't say, I don't know enough about the Tremere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-04T11:48:03-08:00","id":1165106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1164782-lilitu-clan?p=1165095#post1165095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fucking Brilliant! I had forgotten they'd announced Spilled Blood, that is the Vampire Book I'm most excited for, I hope they have a side bar for Fallen Clan Dampyr's.<br /> <br /> I think the Clan Disciplines with be Majesty, Nightmare, Resilience or a Cruac like Discipline. I can see the Lilitu having invented the Wet Dreams Devotion.<br /> <br /> As far the Tremere I can't say, I don't know enough about the Tremere.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know that the Tremere in chronicles of darkness are a Mage legacy that was born when vampires tried to diablerize them (it did not work out for the vampires). Also, I think the general design of clans in Requiem is that they have two common disciplines and one clan specific discipline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-04T12:21:36-08:00","id":1165115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ever Professional</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1164782-lilitu-clan?p=1165106#post1165106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know that the Tremere in chronicles of darkness are a Mage legacy that was born when vampires tried to diablerize them (it did not work out for the vampires). Also, I think the general design of clans in Requiem is that they have two common disciplines and one clan specific discipline.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Right. The Lilitu would presumably hold a lost discipline that enabled breath-drinking.<br /> <br /> Or, alternatively, they were a Bloodline from Lilith the Daeva legendary founder, which had a few custom Devotions enabling smoke-snake form (Protean 5, Vigor?) and breath-drinking. <br /> <br /> I'd actually go with the later approach, barring enough other powers to reasonably flesh out a true 5-dot Discipline.<br /> <br /> Tremere.<br /> <br /> The Tremere have a bizarre history. Essentially they went from being an Ars Magica Hermetic house, to a World of Darkness Hermetic house-come-vampire clan, to a Chronicles of Darkness Mage legacy of left-handed soul-eaters. And! Said soul-eaters may or may not have been encouraged by a vampire to pursue their development out of magical curiosity. I'm probably missing something, but essentially the Tremere were written out of the Chronicles of Darkness vampire as being unnecessary when you have two Covenants who gives access to blood magic.<br /> <br /> So, they do not, currently, have a formal place within VtR. Perhaps <i>Spilled Blood</i> will fix this? Dunno, but if they do formalize a vamp group for the CofD, it'll sell the book for them!<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}